# My scope

Copy this file to `.agents/rules/99-me.md` and edit the line below.
`99-*.md` is gitignored, so each teammate has their own without collisions.

I am **Person N**. I own `<folder>/`. My detailed brief is `<folder>/BRIEF.md` — read it
at the start of every task.

When I ask for something that would touch another person's folder, refuse and tell me.
